WEBVTT

00:07:29.597 --> 00:07:32.097
"I realized at some point that being ready

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:36.163
could mean being ready
to learn quickly while doing."

00:07:36.197 --> 00:07:37.897
And, you know, that expression,

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.263
that's exactly what it means
to be an astronaut.

00:07:40.297 --> 00:07:41.597
I know how to do that.

00:07:41.597 --> 00:07:43.830
I can learn on the job,
I can learn quickly.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.597
And so I did dive into this job

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.997
and I did learn quickly while on the job.

00:07:50.297 --> 00:07:53.997
I can't say that I was the best
person ever to hold that job,

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.363
but it was important to me
to do my very best

00:07:57.397 --> 00:07:59.297
and to be part of this new team.

00:07:59.297 --> 00:08:01.763
Women are particularly prone
to this where we think,